/**
\page page_sttriggerdata2017 StTriggerData2017

\brief Concrete StTriggerData implementation for STAR Run 17 (year 2017) trigger data.

\section sec2017_overview Overview

StTriggerData2017 is the concrete implementation of the StTriggerData abstract interface for
<b>STAR Run 17 (year 2017)</b> raw trigger data.  It wraps a \c TriggerDataBlk2017 structure
(from \c StDaqLib/TRG/trgStructures2017.h) and exposes its content through the common
StTriggerData accessor API.

Compared to StTriggerData2016, Run 17 introduces the first EPD trigger readout (epdADC/epdTDC),
BBC 5-bit TDC, BBC BB101/BB102 board access, trigger detector/crate masks, and additional
FMS QT crate blocks (mFQ1, mFQ2).

\section sec2017_hierarchy Class Hierarchy
\code
StObject
  └── StTriggerData          (abstract interface)
        └── StTriggerData2017
\endcode

\section sec2017_runyear Run Year
Run 17, calendar year 2017 &mdash; Au+Au collisions at &radic;s = 54.4 GeV.

\section sec2017_datamembers Data Members

| Member | Type | Description |
|--------|------|-------------|
| mData  | TriggerDataBlk2017* | Pointer to the raw Run 17 trigger data block. |
| EvtDesc | EvtDescData2017* | Decoded event descriptor (transient). |
| L1_DSM  | L1_DSM_Data2017* | Decoded L1 DSM data (transient). |
| TrgSum  | TrgSumData2017* | Decoded trigger summary (transient). |
| mEPQ[11] | QTBlock2017*[11] | EPD QT crate blocks (transient; replaces FEQ from 2016). |
| mFQ1[11], mFQ2[11] | QTBlock2017*[11] | Additional FMS QT blocks (transient). |

\section sec2017_new New Compared to 2016

<b>EPD (first readout):</b>
- epdADC(int crt, int adr, int ch, int prepost=0)
- epdTDC(int crt, int adr, int ch, int prepost=0)

<b>BBC:</b>
- bbcTDC5bit(StBeamDirection, int pmt, int prepost=0)
- bbcBB101(int ch, int prepost=0)
- bbcBB102(int ch, int prepost=0)

<b>Trigger masks:</b>
- getTrgDetMask() &mdash; detector bit mask.
- getTrgCrateMask() &mdash; crate bit mask.

\section sec2017_usage Usage Example
\code{.cpp}
StEvent* event = static_cast<StEvent*>(GetInputDS("StEvent"));
const StTriggerData* trgData = event->triggerData();
if (trgData) {
    unsigned short epdAdc  = trgData->epdADC(0, 0, 3, 0);
    unsigned short bb101   = trgData->bbcBB101(5, 0);
    unsigned short detMask = trgData->getTrgDetMask();
}
\endcode

\see StTriggerData
\see StTriggerData2016
\see StTriggerData2018
*/
